        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01915",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "这就是说，你是古老的象征派诗人啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In other words, you are an old-fashioned symbolist poet!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01915",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "何苦去试图把科学的碎片当作诗歌的语言呢，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why go out of your way to try to make fragments of science into the language of poetry,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01915",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "因为科学不是女人感情的象征嘛。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "when science is not a symbol of a woman's feelings.\"",
